==Battleground==
*2 [[Znache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Deathshund]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Cruel Angel Clionel]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Zuche]]s spawn, delay 46.67~50 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,500f</sup>.
**1 [[Zapy]] spawns.
**3 [[Znache]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 40~43.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,300f</sup>.
**2 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Deathshund]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is very easy to rush down with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]]. Keep cycling [[Ototo Corps#Holy Blast|Holy Blasts]] until the first Deathsund dies, since you don't want it reviving and staggering up your unit flow. Try to leave the field with just [[Wushu Cat (Rare Cat)|Shigong Cats]] slowly advancing to the enemy base, then start spawning fast meatshields like [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Sumo Cat (Special Cat)|Riceball Cat]] so that they reach the enemy base at around the same time your Shigongs do. Now, time Bahamut so that he's the one hitting the enemy base, that way he deals major damage to Zapy, knocking her back on rebound. Send out Boulder Cat so that he isn't instantly killed by Zapy before Bahamut finishes his backswing. After Zapy dies, there is basically nothing stopping Bahamut, alongside other rushers like [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fishman Cat]] and [[Food Stall Cat (Rare Cat)|Cafeteria Cat]], from tearing Clionel a new one. You don't have to worry about the second Deathshund, it will not get a chance to wreak havoc.

On {{2c}}, Bahamut won't deal enough to knock back Zapy. However, it's easy to make up that difference with two small Attack Up [[Cat Combo]]s.

